        "Proven `runner_admission_blocker` routes to `blocked`.",
        "Proven `execution_lapse` routes to `beacon-qa`.",
        "Proven `skill_defect` becomes research/change proposal input only.",
        "Unproven or ambiguous evidence becomes `evidence_insufficient`.",
        "Release readiness consumes only formal QA closure after attribution is recorded."
      ]
